 (wiring-decision
  ((case "consumer's minimum-retention-until is set to current-time (not now+14d): the producer retains 14d from bundle creation, so a later-dated consumer minimum would always trip retention-shortfall and reuse could never activate; the equality still enforces that expired evidence is rejected via retention-expired")
   (why "the consumer's honest requirement is 'the evidence must still be retained now'; step 13 semantics preserved, no validator change")
   (case2 "the consumer copies environment/policy/selection/artifact expectations from the downloaded producer bundle: the pre-decided design (W0 dup-04 'same selection/env/strictness') plus fail-closed equality either way; a future platform-accurate split needs a positive §4.4 compatibility proof and is out of scope")
   (why2 "the validator pins the equality regardless of where the expectation text comes from; the request is the consumer's own file, built per run")))
 (residual
  "tests/test-interfaces-tui.rkt fails in this sandbox (selection-text P1 check at tests/test-interfaces-tui.rkt:906; TTY-sensitive) in fast shard 5. Proven pre-existing on the untouched base: the identical failure reproduces in a throwaway worktree at base 9112e1ec with none of this wave's changes (racket tests/test-interfaces-tui.rkt -> same check, same line). Same family is already on the W3/W5 record. Recorded, not coerced; this wave's diff cannot affect it.")
